sequenceDiagram
  participant G as guest's client
  participant R as GitLab room (server)
  participant M as members' clients
  M->>R: any change (also the room's own: merge, commit)
  R->>R: keep what guests may not change
  G->>R: update: main.typ edited, .gitlab-ci.yml changed
  R->>M: relayed
  R->>R: .gitlab-ci.yml differs from what was kept
  R->>M: .gitlab-ci.yml written back (the room's own change)
  R-->>G: refused: "Guests may change only Typst files, …"
  Note over R,M: main.typ keeps the guest's edit, and a commit sees only the kept .gitlab-ci.yml
